      "writtenOn": "2021-04-16T17:45:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You suggestion will catch someone using one of the cros EC GPIO+_INT_* macros since they all set GPIO_INPUT (bit 8), which is outside the set of Zephyr GPIO interrupt flags [18:14].  \n\nMy check also ensures that the user has specified supported combination of the Zephyr GPIO int flags. For example if a user tried to enable a level interrupt at both high and low level, this would pass your check.\n\nI prefer the more explicit checking of my approach.",
